# v1.0.12

## New Features

- **Connection Limiter**: Per-user concurrent connection limiting
  - Monitors Hysteria2 server logs in real-time
  - Kicks users who exceed `MAX_CONNECTIONS` simultaneous connections
  - Users with `unlimited_user=true` are exempt
  - Runs as a systemd service (`hysteria-conn-limit.service`)
  - New API endpoints under `/api/v1/hysteria/conn-limit/`:
    - `POST /start` — start the service
    - `POST /stop` — stop the service
    - `POST /config` — set `max_connections`
    - `GET /config` — get current setting
